{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50922","headline":"题画 · 吕从庆","name":"题画","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪石倚危峦，横烟出深谷。\n其间有孤松，亭亭表苍绿。\n擕筇者伊谁？顶髪髠且秃。\n请君过柴桥，临流味幽独。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}